   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "LIGHT & LOOK\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 2, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Key direction\n   2 Contrast\n   3 Color of the light\n   4 Lighting\n   5 Time of day\n   6 Softness\n   7 Rim light\n   8 Sources\n   9 Source in frame\n  10 Shaped light\n  11 Air\n  12 When the light changes\n  13 Brightness key\n  14 Render style\n  15 Ink line\n  16 Gloss\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 3, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Wetness\n   2 Light in skin\n   3 Something glows\n   4 Wear\n   5 Color saturation\n   6 Dominant color\n   7 Lighting\n   8 Light setup\n   9 Surfaces and materials\n  10 Skin\n  11 Drawn or real look\n  12 Layers of the picture\n  13 suite: Noir\n  14 suite: Golden hour\n  15 suite: Comic ink\n  16 suite: Wet night\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 3, CC 17 to 32\n   1 suite: Clean product\n   2 suite: Neon night\n   3 suite: Candlelit\n   4 suite: Sitcom bright\n   5 suite: Interrogation\n   6 suite: Campfire night\n   7 suite: Warm animated feature\n   8 pair: When the render goes toon, the ink line is heavy\n   9 pair: When a secret comes out, the face goes half lit\n  10 pair: After a loss, the color drains\n  11 pair: A flashback brings the faded look\n  12 pair: When danger rises, the shadows deepen\n  13 pair: A reunion warms the color\n  14 pair: When the fire grows, faces go warm and red\n  15 pairs: Weather and surface\n  16 pairs: Light follows feeling"
   },
